   "text": "Sunday listen back and fix one thing. That's 90 minutes and by Sunday the episode exists."
  },
  {
   "s": 26.54,
   "e": 28.92,
   "text": "Send this to the friend who's waiting for a quiet month."
  },
  {
   "s": 28.92,
